# Package locks (auto-generated, not needed in marketplace)
# package-lock.json is COMMITTED, deliberately. It was ignored, so `npm ci`
# was impossible and CI fell back to `npm install`: every run, every
# colleague install and every deploy resolved a different tree, and the
# tree that was tested was never the tree that shipped. That is how a
# 9.8-severity transitive RCE sat in the resolved graph unnoticed.

# Credential files - NEVER commit
skill-key/
*Credentials*.json
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key
token.json
client_secret*.json
